  "acceptance": [
    "Design a SUBFLOW node with a published child-flow selector and typed input/output mappings through structured Chinese controls; users never write flow IDs or JSON.",
    "Reject self references, unavailable or cross-scope children and direct/indirect subflow cycles at publication; a running parent uses the frozen child version and mapping.",
    "Persist an inspectable parent-instance, parent-execution and child-instance relationship. Parent waiting and child success resume are restart-safe and exactly once; child failure is visible and can be retried or recovered without silently completing the parent.",
    "Show child relation, waiting, completion and failure reasons in runtime/history; verify actual API, database, ordinary GUI, failure/retry, same-backend restart and exact cleanup without adding another workflow engine or scheduler."
  ],
  "environment": "Reuse running shared redis:6379 with its existing authentication; project unexamine-redis-1 MUST stay stopped. Existing unexamine-mysql-1:33077 and same unexamine-golden-backend:18080 (existing network/jar/business-files mounts), one native Vite:15173. Backend healthy/preflight5/schema43. Do not full compose up, create duplicate frontend/backend/cache environments, use Testcontainers or change unrelated dm8/es8104. JDK21 native focused compile/tests work. Prefer current services and readback for this completion effort; preserve credentials internally, never write them to evidence.",
